{
  "models/ols_linear_regression/index.html": "$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{OLS}}(\\beta) = \\frac{1}{2n} \\|y - X\\beta\\|_2^2 \\implies \\hat{\\beta} = (X^T X)^{-1} X^T y$$",
  "models/ridge_regression/index.html": "$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Ridge}}(\\beta) = \\frac{1}{2n} \\|y - X\\beta\\|_2^2 + \\lambda \\|\\beta\\|_2^2 \\implies \\hat{\\beta} = (X^T X + \\lambda I)^{-1} X^T y$$",
