  "models/decision_tree_regressor/index.html": "$$\\Delta \\text{MSE} = \\text{MSE}(D) - \\frac{|D_L|}{|D|}\\text{MSE}(D_L) - \\frac{|D_R|}{|D|}\\text{MSE}(D_R)$$",
