  "models/gradient_boosting_regressor/index.html": "$$F_m(x) = F_{m-1}(x) + \\eta \\sum_{j} \\gamma_{jm} \\mathbb{I}(x \\in R_{jm}), \\quad r_{im} = -\\left[\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}(y_i, F(x_i))}{\\partial F(x_i)}\\right]_{F=F_{m-1}}$$",
  "models/xgboost_regressor/index.html": "$$\\mathcal{L}^{(t)} \\approx \\sum_{i=1}^n \\left[ g_i f_t(x_i) + \\frac{1}{2} h_i f_t^2(x_i) \\right] + \\gamma T + \\frac{1}{2}\\lambda \\sum_{j=1}^T w_j^2$$",
  "models/lightgbm_regressor/index.html": "$$\\text{Split Gain} = \\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\frac{(\\sum_{i \\in I_L} g_i)^2}{\\sum_{i \\in I_L} h_i + \\lambda} + \\frac{(\\sum_{i \\in I_R} g_i)^2}{\\sum_{i \\in I_R} h_i + \\lambda} - \\frac{(\\sum_{i \\in I} g_i)^2}{\\sum_{i \\in I} h_i + \\lambda}\\right] - \\gamma$$",
