  "models/mlp_regressor/index.html": "$$h^{(l)} = \\sigma(W^{(l)} h^{(l-1)} + b^{(l)}), \\quad \\mathcal{L} = \\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_{i=1}^n (y_i - W^{(L)}h^{(L-1)} - b^{(L)})^2$$",
